    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Abomifighters: World League is a local coop and online brawler game for up to 4 players. You assemble your character from different body parts and fight your way to victory!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/a7701daf83251141bc2e37eea44c5538.poster.avif?t=1713508018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/a7701daf83251141bc2e37eea44c5538.webm?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/a7701daf83251141bc2e37eea44c5538.mp4?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022 Build absolutely crazy characters. Attach anything to anything: sharkosaurus, broccocopter, zombiecentaurus \u2013 it\u2019s up to you to create your own avatar.<br>\u2022 Unique character creation system: Each limb changes the way you move and fight. You can punch out limbs from your enemies, pick it to retain their abilities and recreate your avatar right in the game.<br>\u2022 Crazy levels: Avoid traps and collect power ups in real world-like levels. <br>\u2022 Co-op or Free-For-All: Team up with your friends and fight with your enemies online. Or be friends with no one in ruthless free for all fights!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/8344ad05cecedab3fa4fa02fbc8ff3e1.poster.avif?t=1713508018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/8344ad05cecedab3fa4fa02fbc8ff3e1.webm?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/8344ad05cecedab3fa4fa02fbc8ff3e1.mp4?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Abomifighters: World League is a local coop and online brawler game for up to 4 players. You assemble your character from different body parts and fight your way to victory!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/a7701daf83251141bc2e37eea44c5538.poster.avif?t=1713508018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/a7701daf83251141bc2e37eea44c5538.webm?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/a7701daf83251141bc2e37eea44c5538.mp4?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022 Build absolutely crazy characters. Attach anything to anything: sharkosaurus, broccocopter, zombiecentaurus \u2013 it\u2019s up to you to create your own avatar.<br>\u2022 Unique character creation system: Each limb changes the way you move and fight. You can punch out limbs from your enemies, pick it to retain their abilities and recreate your avatar right in the game.<br>\u2022 Crazy levels: Avoid traps and collect power ups in real world-like levels. <br>\u2022 Co-op or Free-For-All: Team up with your friends and fight with your enemies online. Or be friends with no one in ruthless free for all fights!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/8344ad05cecedab3fa4fa02fbc8ff3e1.poster.avif?t=1713508018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/8344ad05cecedab3fa4fa02fbc8ff3e1.webm?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788130/extras/8344ad05cecedab3fa4fa02fbc8ff3e1.mp4?t=1713508018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
